---
name: gml-review
description: Review selected GML for real bugs only
invokable: true
---
Review the selected GML. List only concrete problems, most serious first: bugs, leaks (ds/surface/buffer), per-frame waste, functions that do not exist in modern GameMaker. For each: quote the line, one sentence why, a minimal fix. If nothing is wrong, reply "No issues found". No praise, no summary.
